  message: "VALIDATION VERDICT: inconclusive for #2004, moved for #2006. bakeoff-queue drain 2026-11-02 on dev b20da19ff3, cold survey of this item’s own repo(s); record ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_queue_11022026/VERDICTS.md (instruments verify_queue.py / verify_more.py / threeway/). just: measured rust METHOD-call edges bound to a free function: 0 (recorded 241 wrong -> 0) ; just: measured #2006: rust method-call edges bound to a free function 0 (recorded 241 -> 0). Tag KEPT: #2004’s lost-edge numbers were measured on this same tree on 11-02, so re-running reproduces them by construction; it needs a cohort after further resolver work, or an independent re-judging of the lost-edge sample."  # 2a48
- op: discuss  # 0fd2
